# Unit calls of four entries in bank $81 that nothing in the game calls
# (no JSR, JSL, JMP, pointer or word in the ROM names them; each sits just
# past a BRA or a routine's end), each at its own entry by JSL:
# ActorSlowDownMove ($81:A4C4) and ActorSlowDownMoveBy20 ($81:A4CD), the
# slowing twins of ActorSpeedUpMove; ActorPictureSendKind4 ($81:9494), on
# a kind whose set-up index is 4 (kind $20) and on one whose is not (kind
# $51, 2); PlayerInFrontBoxByFlip ($81:AF01), PlayerInFrontBox by the flip.
# On the first level's state at frame 10, M and X 8-bit, DB $80 (where
# the callers of these routines read their tables), D the guard at record
# $0BAB (kind $20) or the kind $51 at $0B5B; box offset X = 0. The machine
# is put back after each call.
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 10
call 81A4C4 long p=30 db=80 d=0BAB
call 81A4CD long p=30 db=80 d=0BAB
call 819494 long p=30 db=80 d=0BAB
call 819494 long p=30 db=80 d=0B5B
call 81AF01 long p=30 db=80 d=0BAB x=00
